{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "kali-sentinel-db-fleet",
  "title": "Kali Sentinel | Database Fleet",
  "tags": [
    "kali-sentinel",
    "database",
    "fleet"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Database fleet coverage",
      "type": "text",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The socket inventory reports current TCP binds for database and broker service ports. A listener proves only that a socket is bound; it does not prove database protocol health, authentication, replication, query performance, backups, or storage capacity. No MySQL/MariaDB/PostgreSQL/Redis performance exporters are currently scraped. MariaDB audit settings were applied at runtime, but plugin state must be verified after database restarts; DBCC heartbeat does not prove audit-source coverage."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "DB performance exporters",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Current Prometheus targets matching common database exporter jobs. 0 means not instrumented.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "NONE",
                  "color": "orange"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up{job=~\".*(mysql|mariadb|postgres|redis).*\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Database/broker sockets",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Current observed TCP LISTEN socket rows on ports 3306, 5432, 5672, or 6381. IPv4 and IPv6 binds are separate rows.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(kali_socket_inventory_last_seen_timestamp_seconds{protocol=\"tcp\",socket_state=\"LISTEN\",local_port=~\"3306|5432|5672|6381\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Wildcard-bound sockets",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Listener rows bound to 0.0.0.0 or ::. Review reachability and firewall policy; this is not proof of external access.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(kali_socket_inventory_last_seen_timestamp_seconds{protocol=\"tcp\",socket_state=\"LISTEN\",local_port=~\"3306|5432|5672|6381\",exposure=\"wildcard\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "DBCC metrics scrape",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Prometheus reachability of the DBCC metrics endpoint only.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "gray",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "-1": {
                  "text": "NO TARGET",
                  "color": "gray"
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "FAILED",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "SCRAPED",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(up{job=\"dbcc-dam-metrics\"}) or vector(-1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "DAM events stored (total)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Cumulative DBCC normalized event count, not limited to the selected time range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "-1": {
                  "text": "NO DATA",
                  "color": "gray"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(dbcc_dam_events_stored{job=\"dbcc-dam-metrics\"}) or vector(-1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Collector heartbeat age",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Seconds since the DBCC collector heartbeat. Fresh heartbeat does not verify MariaDB audit-plugin state.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 60
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "-1": {
                  "text": "NO DATA",
                  "color": "gray"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(time()-dbcc_dam_collector_heartbeat_timestamp_seconds{job=\"dbcc-dam-metrics\"}) or vector(-1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Observed database and broker listeners",
      "type": "table",
      "description": "Socket-level inventory for configured database/broker ports. Process name and PID may be unavailable without narrowly scoped privileges; listener presence is not a database health check.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "dateTimeAsIso",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Port",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "kali_socket_inventory_last_seen_timestamp_seconds{protocol=\"tcp\",socket_state=\"LISTEN\",local_port=~\"3306|5432|5672|6381\"} * 1000",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "cluster": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "service": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "local_port": 0,
              "application_name": 1,
              "container_name": 2,
              "protocol": 3,
              "socket_state": 4,
              "local_address": 5,
              "interface": 6,
              "exposure": 7,
              "process_name": 8,
              "pid": 9,
              "availability": 10,
              "Value": 11
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "local_port": "Port",
              "application_name": "Application",
              "container_name": "Container",
              "protocol": "Protocol",
              "socket_state": "State",
              "local_address": "Bind address",
              "interface": "Interface",
              "exposure": "Exposure",
              "process_name": "Process",
              "pid": "PID",
              "availability": "Availability",
              "Value": "Last seen"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "DAM event rate by category",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Five-minute event rate by bounded event type and collector-reported outcome.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by(event_type,outcome)(rate(dbcc_dam_events_total{engine=\"mariadb\",job=\"dbcc-dam-metrics\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{event_type}} / {{outcome}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "DAM events by category in selected period",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Rounded counter increases over the selected dashboard time range, grouped by event type.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by(event_type)(increase(dbcc_dam_events_total{engine=\"mariadb\",job=\"dbcc-dam-metrics\"}[$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{event_type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Observed binds and data limits",
      "type": "text",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Current socket observations:** TCP 3306 is wildcard-bound with process identity unavailable; 5432 and 5672 are loopback-bound; Redis port 6381 has IPv4 and IPv6 wildcard listeners. The exporter jobs above are absent, so engine-level utilization, query latency, replication, backups, and storage metrics are not available. Verify firewall reachability separately. Open [socket inventory](http://localhost:13000/d/kali-sentinel-sockets/kali-sentinel-listening-sockets) or [DBCC normalized events](http://127.0.0.1:18765/)."
      }
    }
  ],
